! examples/h2h_gmin_sw.data on the Tersoff carbon dimer scales, for the
! GMIN binary scripts/covalent_h2h/build_gmin_tersoff.sh links to rgpot.
! The dimer bond is 1.2892326 Angstrom and its energy 5.1661751 eV, the
! scales examples/h2h_covalent prints. Every length, energy and gradient
! in the silicon file is multiplied by them, SW's sigma and epsilon read
! as one dimer length and one dimer energy.
! The driver appends one RANSEED line per run.

SLOPPYCONV 2.0036D-2
TIGHTCONV 4.0072D-3
EDIFF 0.015499
MAXIT 600 500
SAVE 2
CENTRE
SORT

TEMPERATURE 1.0332
STEPS 90000000 1.0
STEP 0.51569 0.65751
NEWRESTART 40
AVOID 5.1569 20 F
USERPOT
